格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Stata-MCP: A MCP server for integrating Stata into your agent loop with a safety-first design.","id":"gh:956330003","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"mcp-for-stata","slug":"SepineTam/mcp-for-stata","topics":["claude-code","claude-code-plugin","claude-code-skill","codex","codex-plugin","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","econometrics","empirical","empirical-research","llm","mcp","safety","security","social-science","social-science-research","stata","stata-mcp","statistical-analysis"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Stata-MCP: A MCP server for integrating Stata into your agent loop with a safety-first design."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# MCP-for-Stata (Stata-MCP): Run Stata with ANY Agent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"MCP-for-Stata is an safety first open-source MCP server and CLI tool with Skills lets any AI agent y"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ou use invoke local Stata on your device for regression analysis, econometrics, paper replication, a"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"nd empirical research. It provides command guards, resource monitoring, automatic log capture, and c"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"ross-platform client installation, while you retain control of your data and Stata license."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Turn Claude Code, Codex, and other AI agents into an on-demand research assistant."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Stata is a registered trademark of StataCorp LLC. This project is an independent community-develop"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ed tool and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by StataCorp LLC."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 💡 Quick Start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"You do not need to edit any configuration. Just tell your agent:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 🆕 News\n- 📖 **Skills installed by default**: Stata-related skills are now installed together with "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"the MCP, no separate setup needed. See the installation guide.\n- 🚀 **DeepSeek Harness Day 0 Support*"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"*: Install MCP-for-Stata in DeepSeek Harness with `uvx stata-mcp install -c dsh`. See the DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"arness guide.\n- 🧪 **Claude Science Support**: MCP-for-Stata now works in Claude Science with a sandb"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ox allowlist. See the Claude Science guide.\n- Find more in WeChat: Why I made it?, and 8 figures fin"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"d out Stata-MCP\n- 🦞 **OpenClaw Support**: Standalone CLI tools for OpenClaw integration (`stata-mcp "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"tool`), see OpenClaw guide\n- ✨ **Claude Code Plugin Support**: Official plugin package with MCP serv"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"er and Stata LSP integration\n- Use MCP-for-Stata in Claude Code, see Claude Code advanced usage, or "},{"id":"p9s9","text":"in Codex see Codex advanced usage"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> Finding our **newest research**? View latest research reports."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Looking for others?"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> **MCP or AI about Stata**\n> - A session based MCP server for Stata, mcp-stata\n> - IDEs (VScode or "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"Cursor) integrated stata-mcp for VSCode. Confused them? 💡 Comparison\n>\n> **Datasets and Information*"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"*\n> - STOP Dataset: StataMCP-Team Opendata Project 📊, we have open-sourced a comprehensive dataset c"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ollection for social science research, aiming to enable the future of AI-driven and data-powered res"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"cial science research, aiming to enable the future of AI-driven and data-powered research paradigms."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Why AGPL 3.0 License?"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The AGPL 3.0 License is a type of open-source license. It does not affect your daily use, and allows"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" you to use, modify, and distribute this software free of charge, provided that you comply with its "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"terms, such as retaining the original copyright notices."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Notes**: While we strive to make open source accessible to everyone, we regret that we can no long"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"er maintain the Apache-2.0 License. Due to individuals directly copying this project and claiming to"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" be its maintainers, we have decided to change the license to AGPL-3.0 to prevent misuse of the proj"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ect in ways that go against our original vision."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Installation and Client Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"See the **Installation Guide** for installation methods,\nclient setup, addon/extra options, and veri"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"*Installation Guide** for installation methods,\nclient setup, addon/extra options, and verification."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 🚀 One-click installation for all clients!\nNo config, no manual JSON editing. Just one command in"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"stalls MCP-for-Stata for **every supported agent** (Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Cursor, Gemini CLI"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"or-Stata for **every supported agent** (Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and more):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Supported Agents 🤖\nBased on our own experience and testing, we recommend using Claude Code, Codex, a"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nd OpenClaw.\nWe have found that Claude and DeepSeek are the two best models across any framework."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Agent                     | Tag      | Command                           |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Claude Desktop            | claude   | uvx stata-mcp install -c claude   |\n| Claude Code          "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"     | cc       | uvx stata-mcp install -c cc       |\n| Gemini CLI                | gemini   | uvx s"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"tata-mcp install -c gemini   |\n| Cursor                    | cursor   | uvx stata-mcp install -c cur"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"sor   |\n| Cline (VScode Extension)  | cline    | uvx stata-mcp install -c cline    |\n| Codex CLI & C"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"odex Desktop | codex    | uvx stata-mcp install -c codex    |\n| OpenCode                  | opencode"},{"id":"p23s6","text":" | uvx stata-mcp install -c opencode |\n| OpenClaw                  | openclaw | uvx stata-mcp instal"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"l -c openclaw |\n| Claude Science            | —        | Manual config |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"If you don't have `uv`, see the uv installation guide to install it.\nOr, use our beta install script"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" (auto-installs `uv` if missing):"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**macOS / Linux:**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Windows (PowerShell):**"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If you don't know how to use them, download the installation scripts and double-click it in your dev"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ice. `install.bat` for Windows users, and `install.command` for macOS users."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Prerequisites\n- uv - Package installer and virtual environment manager\n- Claude Code, Codex, Ope"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"nClaw or other Agents\n- Stata License\n- Your API-KEY from LLM"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"If you want to check whether your device is supported, you can run:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"It displays basic information about your device and checks whether your setup is supported."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Example output"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"> Notes:\n> 1. If you are located in China and package downloads are slow, see the solution.\n> 2. Cla"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ude is the best choice for MCP-for-Stata, for Chinese, I recommend to use DeepSeek as your model pro"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"vider as it is cheap and powerful, also the score is highest in China provider, if you are increased"},{"id":"p36s4","text":" in it, visit the report How to use StataMCP improve your social science research."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### Key Features\n- **Security Guard**: Blocks dangerous commands (`!`, `shell`, `erase`, etc.)\n- **R"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"AM Monitoring**: Prevents memory exhaustion with configurable limits\n- **Layered Configuration**: Us"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"er, project, environment, and Linux system config support\n- **Beta async `stata_do` execution**: Sup"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ports concurrent MCP calls for multi-client workflows\n- **Configurable data access boundaries**: Dat"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"a info URL guard and optional direct `read_log` boundary\n- Cross-platform support (macOS, Windows, L"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"inux)\n- Automatic log capture and error reporting"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
